	<string name="hwp.farming.seed_text_herb">A Holy Herb strain. Plant on a farm plot in town: ready after %runs% runs, %wet% if watered. A plant grows on every other spot; harvest one bud for each, to sell or roll into a joint (click it under Plants &amp; Herbs in the materials).</string>
	<string name="hwp.farming.slot_title">Watering can</string>
	<string name="hwp.farming.slot_text">Water: %n%/%max%, area %area%\nUse it on growing crops between runs: watered crops grow twice as fast. Each pour waters the row and its neighbours in the field. Refill it at the farm well.</string>
	<string name="hwp.farming.slot_none">You have no watering can yet. The farmer between the fields sells one.</string>

